@startuml
note as machineNote
    The model's own JSON shape: every concept, no extension vocabulary needed.
end note
legend
    target = 21
    current = 18
endlegend
[*] --> off
state off
state on {
    [*] --> decide
    [H] --> decide
    state decide <<choice>>
    state heating <<actuator>>
    note right of heating : Burner on.
    state cooling <<actuator>>
    state steady
    decide --> heating: [ current < target - 1 ]
    decide --> cooling: [ current > target + 1 ]
    decide --> steady
    heating --> decide: after(60s)
    cooling --> decide: after(60s)
    steady --> decide: after(5m)
}
on : entry / display.on()
on : do / sample sensor every 10s
on : exit / display.off()
on : schedule / defer
on : [ target > 5 ]
off --> on: power
on --> off: power
on --> [*]: sensorError
note on link : Unrecoverable.
on : setTarget\n/ target = value
@enduml
